  "revision_note": "v1 (74b5858) registered the AT2G container.  B3-AT2B-1 then ADDED two methods to the same file (`D3StateContainer.adopt`, which lets the container take ownership of the environment objects without copying, and `set_context`, which keeps the sanctioned epoch context current) plus an epoch guard for an incomplete context, so v2 refreshes the container hash and the AT2G evidence.  The AT2G suite was RE-RUN after the change: all 13 verdicts and all three sub-proofs are unchanged (instances 0-5 refreshed in raw/), so the addition is behaviour-preserving for AT2G.  No pin changed and v1 stays byte-intact in history."
